{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-subsidy-tradein","title":"平台与品牌换新补贴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/platform-subsidy-tradein","wordCount":2183,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"平台与品牌换新补贴\">平台与品牌换新补贴</h1><p>上一代旗舰机型上市满一年时，品牌方通常会做一轮「以旧换新至高补贴 X 元」的活动；同一时间平台自己也有一轮「换新加码」的预算。用户看到的是&quot;补贴后到手价&quot;，但这两个「补贴」是两笔完全不同来源的钱：一笔是品牌方的市场费用，一笔是平台的营销费用。它们的结算主体不同、核销口径不同、税务处理不同，却常常要在同一张订单上叠加。补贴系统要解决的核心问题是：给定一笔订单，如何判定哪些补贴可以同时生效、上限是多少、以及每一分补贴最终由谁付。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-补贴的四种来源与它们的约束\">核心概念：补贴的四种来源与它们的约束</h2><p>按出资主体与生效条件，换新补贴可以分成四类，每类的判定逻辑各不相同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[换新订单] --&gt; S1[平台换新加码&lt;br/&gt;平台出资 / 按订单]&#10;  O --&gt; S2[品牌换新补贴&lt;br/&gt;品牌出资 / 按机型]&#10;  O --&gt; S3[政府消费补贴&lt;br/&gt;财政出资 / 按品类+地区]&#10;  O --&gt; S4[旧机型定向加价&lt;br/&gt;品牌出资 / 按折旧表]&#10;  S1 --&gt; R{互斥与叠加上限判定}&#10;  S2 --&gt; R&#10;  S3 --&gt; R&#10;  S4 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; A[最终补贴金额]&#10;  R --&gt; L[各出资方的入账明细]\">graph TD\n  O[换新订单] --&gt; S1[平台换新加码&lt;br/&gt;平台出资 / 按订单]\n  O --&gt; S2[品牌换新补贴&lt;br/&gt;品牌出资 / 按机型]\n  O --&gt; S3[政府消费补贴&lt;br/&gt;财政出资 / 按品类+地区]\n  O --&gt; S4[旧机型定向加价&lt;br/&gt;品牌出资 / 按折旧表]\n  S1 --&gt; R{互斥与叠加上限判定}\n  S2 --&gt; R\n  S3 --&gt; R\n  S4 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; A[最终补贴金额]\n  R --&gt; L[各出资方的入账明细]</pre><p><strong>平台换新加码</strong>由平台自己出，通常与订单金额或换新行为挂钩，是最灵活的一类。<strong>品牌换新补贴</strong>由品牌方出，一般按机型定向，且有活动周期与总量上限。<strong>政府消费补贴</strong>由财政出资，有严格的品类、地区、单价上限与身份资格要求，是合规约束最强的一类。<strong>旧机型定向加价</strong>是品牌为了推动特定老机型退出市场而给的额外加价，本质上是品牌补贴的一种定向形式。</p>\n<p>四类补贴在实际活动里经常同时出现，且往往以「换新加码」这类统一话术面向用户。能否叠加不取决于话术，而取决于每笔资金的来源规则——这也是为什么补贴系统必须能回答「这笔优惠具体由谁出资」，而不只是记录一个总减免额。品牌方的换新补贴常与自己机型的换新定价表绑定（Apple 的换新页面对同一设备的估价按机型与成色给出不同档位，并说明价值随条件、年份与配置变化，见 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/trade-in\">Apple Trade In</a>），与平台自出的加码是两套定价逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>出资方</th>\n<th>判定键</th>\n<th>常见约束</th>\n<th>结算对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台加码</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>订单/用户</td>\n<td>预算池、每日上限</td>\n<td>内部营销科目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌补贴</td>\n<td>品牌</td>\n<td>机型 + 活动期</td>\n<td>总量上限、机型白名单</td>\n<td>品牌方对账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政府补贴</td>\n<td>财政</td>\n<td>品类 + 地区 + 资格</td>\n<td>单价上限、实名、不可叠加</td>\n<td>申报核销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向加价</td>\n<td>品牌</td>\n<td>具体机型</td>\n<td>折旧表匹配</td>\n<td>品牌方对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"互斥与叠加的判定\">互斥与叠加的判定</h2><p>补贴叠加不能靠一堆 if-else，它需要一张显式的规则表，因为规则会被运营频繁调整，且不同市场（法域）的规则不同。规则表的核心是三个字段：适用范围（哪些补贴）、叠加关系（互斥 / 可叠加 / 取最大）、以及叠加上限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;cn-2026-q4-tradein&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;CN&quot;,&#10;  &quot;applicable&quot;: [&quot;platform_bonus&quot;, &quot;brand_subsidy&quot;, &quot;gov_consumption&quot;],&#10;  &quot;stacking&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;gov_consumption&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;exclusive_with&quot;,&#10;      &quot;targets&quot;: [&quot;platform_bonus&quot;],&#10;      &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;财政补贴通常要求不可与经营者其他优惠叠加&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;brand_subsidy&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;additive_with&quot;,&#10;      &quot;targets&quot;: [&quot;platform_bonus&quot;],&#10;      &quot;cap_pct_of_order&quot;: 0.3&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;global_cap_cents&quot;: 80000,&#10;  &quot;priority_order&quot;: [&quot;gov_consumption&quot;, &quot;brand_subsidy&quot;, &quot;platform_bonus&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cn-2026-q4-tradein\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"applicable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_bonus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand_subsidy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gov_consumption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stacking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gov_consumption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exclusive_with\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_bonus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"财政补贴通常要求不可与经营者其他优惠叠加\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"brand_subsidy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"additive_with\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_bonus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cap_pct_of_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"global_cap_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gov_consumption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand_subsidy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_bonus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段的工程含义需要展开。<code>mode: exclusive_with</code> 表示一旦命中政府补贴，平台加码必须让位——这不是平台的选择，而是财政资金的合规要求。<code>cap_pct_of_order</code> 用<strong>订单金额的百分比</strong>而非固定金额作为上限，因为固定金额在低价订单上会让补贴超过商品价值，形成套利空间（买一台 200 元的配件，抵 300 元补贴）。<code>priority_order</code> 决定互斥冲突时谁胜出，它必须显式而不是靠规则数组的顺序，因为规则表会被人工编辑，隐式顺序是 bug 温床。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么政府补贴必须优先且互斥\">为什么政府补贴必须优先且互斥</h3><p>政府消费补贴的典型设计是「按最终成交价的一定比例、有单价上限、须实名且不可与其他优惠叠加」。这意味着如果先算平台加码把价格压低，再按比例算政府补贴，财政资金就被用来补贴了平台自己给的折扣——这在审计上是不允许的。因此判定顺序必须是：先确定政府补贴的适用性与金额（基于原价口径），再在剩余空间内叠加经营者的优惠。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def resolve_subsidies(order, rules):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;按 priority_order 逐个判定，返回各项金额与出资方明细。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    applied, blocked = [], []&#10;    remaining_cap = rules[&quot;global_cap_cents&quot;]&#10;    for key in rules[&quot;priority_order&quot;]:&#10;        rule = rules[&quot;stacking&quot;].get(key)&#10;        if rule and rule[&quot;mode&quot;] == &quot;exclusive_with&quot;:&#10;            hit = [t for t in rule[&quot;targets&quot;] if t in [a[&quot;key&quot;] for a in applied]]&#10;            if hit:&#10;                blocked.append({&quot;key&quot;: key, &quot;blocked_by&quot;: hit, &quot;reason&quot;: rule[&quot;reason&quot;]})&#10;                continue&#10;        amount = compute_amount(order, key)&#10;        if rule and &quot;cap_pct_of_order&quot; in rule:&#10;            amount = min(amount, int(order[&quot;order_total_cents&quot;] * rule[&quot;cap_pct_of_order&quot;]))&#10;        amount = min(amount, remaining_cap)&#10;        if amount &lt;= 0:&#10;            continue&#10;        applied.append({&quot;key&quot;: key, &quot;amount_cents&quot;: amount,&#10;                        &quot;funder&quot;: FUNDER_OF[key]})&#10;        remaining_cap -= amount&#10;    return {&quot;applied&quot;: applied, &quot;blocked&quot;: blocked,&#10;            &quot;total_cents&quot;: sum(a[&quot;amount_cents&quot;] for a in applied)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve_subsidies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order, rules):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"按 priority_order 逐个判定，返回各项金额与出资方明细。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    applied, blocked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    remaining_cap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"global_cap_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"priority_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rules[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stacking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].get(key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"exclusive_with\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            hit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [a[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> applied]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                blocked.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blocked_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: hit, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: rule[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_amount(order, key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cap_pct_of_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_total_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cap_pct_of_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, remaining_cap)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        applied.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                        \"funder\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FUNDER_OF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[key]})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        remaining_cap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: applied, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blocked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: blocked,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"total_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> applied)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个函数有两个设计要点。<strong>先判定后计算</strong>：互斥判定在金额计算之前完成，避免先算出金额再因为互斥被丢弃，从而产生「用户看到了一个最终没有生效的金额」的体验问题。<strong>blocked 明细必须返回</strong>：当用户发现某笔补贴没生效，客服需要能回答是哪条规则挡住了它，这个信息不能靠事后人工推演。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补贴与换新抵扣的叠加\">补贴与换新抵扣的叠加</h2><p>补贴与换新抵扣是两类不同的减项，它们的叠加需要在订单上分别体现。误区在于把补贴直接加进抵扣金额——那样会让「旧品值多少钱」这个概念被营销费用污染，用户在到检差异时无法理解为什么抵扣变了。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是在订单上并列两个科目：<strong>换新抵扣</strong>（来自旧品残值，受第一章与第三章的规则约束）与<strong>营销优惠</strong>（来自补贴，受本篇规则约束）。用户在订单明细上看到的是两行，到检调整只影响第一行（差异如何结算见 <a href=\"../tradein-collect-logistics/price-diff-settlement\">估价差异补退结算</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>科目</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>是否受到检影响</th>\n<th>可否叠加</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>换新抵扣</td>\n<td>旧品残值</td>\n<td>是（特征级调整）</td>\n<td>与补贴独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台加码</td>\n<td>平台营销</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>视规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌补贴</td>\n<td>品牌市场费</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>视规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政府补贴</td>\n<td>财政</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>通常互斥</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 订单优惠明细：抵扣与补贴分科目入账&#10;CREATE TABLE order_adjustments (&#10;  adjustment_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES orders(order_id),&#10;  kind           TEXT NOT NULL,   -- TRADEIN_CREDIT | SUBSIDY&#10;  source         TEXT,            -- platform_bonus | brand_subsidy | gov_consumption&#10;  funder         TEXT NOT NULL,   -- platform | brand:&lt;id&gt; | government:&lt;scheme&gt;&#10;  amount_cents   INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (amount_cents &gt;= 0),&#10;  rule_id        TEXT,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单优惠明细：抵扣与补贴分科目入账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_adjustments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  adjustment_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- TRADEIN_CREDIT | SUBSIDY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- platform_bonus | brand_subsidy | gov_consumption</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  funder         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- platform | brand:&#x3C;id> | government:&#x3C;scheme></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount_cents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>funder</code> 字段是可对账性的关键：品牌方按 <code>funder = &#39;brand:&lt;id&gt;&#39;</code> 拉取对账数据，财政按 <code>funder = &#39;government:&lt;scheme&gt;&#39;</code> 拉取申报数据。把出资方做成结构化字段而不是备注，对账才能自动化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补贴的资金池与占用\">补贴的资金池与占用</h3><p>有总量上限的补贴（尤其是品牌补贴）必须有资金池控制。资金池的正确实现是<strong>预留-核销-释放</strong>三步，而不是「先扣后查」：用户下单时预留（reserve）额度，订单完成后核销（commit），订单取消或到检失败时释放（release）。这与抵扣的挂账模型在结构上同构，可以用同一套幂等写入与唯一约束保证不超发。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant U as 用户下单&#10;  participant P as 补贴池&#10;  participant O as 订单&#10;  U-&gt;&gt;P: reserve(brand_budget, amount)&#10;  P--&gt;&gt;U: 预留成功 token&#10;  U-&gt;&gt;O: 创建订单 (携带 token)&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;P: commit(token) 或 release(token)&#10;  P--&gt;&gt;O: 池余额更新\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户下单\n  participant P as 补贴池\n  participant O as 订单\n  U-&gt;&gt;P: reserve(brand_budget, amount)\n  P--&gt;&gt;U: 预留成功 token\n  U-&gt;&gt;O: 创建订单 (携带 token)\n  O-&gt;&gt;P: commit(token) 或 release(token)\n  P--&gt;&gt;O: 池余额更新</pre><p>预留-核销-释放的顺序反过来（先核销再预留）会在并发场景下超发，因为核销时才发现池已空，此时订单已经创建。用 token 把预留与订单绑定，是保证「一笔订单最多消费一个预留」的标准手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账与结算\">对账与结算</h2><p>补贴的最后一公里是对账。平台需要向品牌方与财政分别提交三类数据：<strong>应结金额</strong>（按规则计算）、<strong>实际核销</strong>（订单真实完成）、以及<strong>冲正明细</strong>（取消/退货导致的回收）。这三类的口径差异是纠纷的主要来源——品牌方通常只承认「实际核销」，而平台在下单时就向用户承诺了补贴，中间的时间差由平台垫付。</p>\n<p>对于政府补贴还有一层额外要求：申报数据必须能追溯到单笔订单的资格凭证（实名信息、地区、品类），且通常有申报截止时间。这意味着补贴的入账记录必须保留足够长的窗口与完整的关联键，而不是在订单完成后清理中间数据。哪些字段必须留存，取决于具体财政方案的申报要求；通用做法是保留订单号、资格凭证哈希、金额、时间戳四项最小集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>换新补贴按出资方分四类（平台、品牌、政府、定向加价），判定键与合规约束各不相同，必须用规则表而非 if-else。</li>\n<li>叠加规则显式表达为互斥、可叠加与上限三要素；上限用订单金额百分比而非固定值，避免低价订单套利。</li>\n<li>政府补贴通常要求互斥且须基于原价口径判定，判定顺序必须显式（<code>priority_order</code>）。</li>\n<li>补贴与换新抵扣在订单上分科目并列，到检调整只影响抵扣科目，避免营销费用污染残值概念。</li>\n<li>有上限的补贴用「预留-核销-释放 + token 绑定订单」控制资金池，防止并发超发。</li>\n<li>对账口径的差异（应结 vs 实际核销 vs 冲正）是纠纷主因，出资方必须做成结构化字段以支持自动对账。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台与品牌换新补贴","id":"平台与品牌换新补贴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：补贴的四种来源与它们的约束","id":"核心概念-补贴的四种来源与它们的约束"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥与叠加的判定","id":"互斥与叠加的判定"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么政府补贴必须优先且互斥","id":"为什么政府补贴必须优先且互斥"},{"level":2,"text":"补贴与换新抵扣的叠加","id":"补贴与换新抵扣的叠加"},{"level":3,"text":"补贴的资金池与占用","id":"补贴的资金池与占用"},{"level":2,"text":"对账与结算","id":"对账与结算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"换新抵扣与新品订单联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/tradein-credit-new-order"},"next":{"title":"估价不达标与放弃换新处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-order-link/tradein-quote-fail-handle"}}